{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras/357f021af788d2354b0f44357efcc56a.avif?t=1766238772\" width=740 height=86 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run your nightclub. Lead your gang. Rule the city.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In The Boss Gangsters: Nightlife, you\u2019ll balance a glamorous nightlife business with brutal street power. Manage VIPs, fight rival mafias, and outsmart the corrupt police in a city where every decision matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras/291054ae68654fd0b5adb6b03bff5efd.poster.avif?t=1766238772\" width=770 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras/291054ae68654fd0b5adb6b03bff5efd.webm?t=1766238772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras/291054ae68654fd0b5adb6b03bff5efd.mp4?t=1766238772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to The Boss Gangsters Nightlife! This unique game offers you the perfect opportunity to delve into the depths of both the business world and the criminal underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras/a82c53e44113323ca967e1883e4f44f1.poster.avif?t=1766238772\" width=770 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras/a82c53e44113323ca967e1883e4f44f1.webm?t=1766238772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras/a82c53e44113323ca967e1883e4f44f1.mp4?t=1766238772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage VIPs and drug deals in the same hour. Negotiate with dirty cops or bury your enemies. Every choice you make will shape your rise to power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras/5a62ca9b32dcc8ff7a3f3e060a6a61de.poster.avif?t=1766238772\" width=770 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras/5a62ca9b32dcc8ff7a3f3e060a6a61de.webm?t=1766238772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras/5a62ca9b32dcc8ff7a3f3e060a6a61de.mp4?t=1766238772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Dual gameplay</strong>: Switch seamlessly between nightclub management and open world gangster missions , no loading screens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf78 <strong>Manage your club</strong>: Handle VIP guests, stock bars, hire dancers, and throw wild themed nights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde8 <strong>Gang wars</strong>: Eliminate rivals, bury bodies, and defend your turf from enemy attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc6e <strong>Corruption system</strong>: Bribe the police, influence the mayor, or risk violent raids.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>RPG Mechanics:</strong> Train your crew and develop your crime family</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Prestige &amp; Unlocks:</strong> As you gain reputation, you\u2019ll unlock special items and new features</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb8 <strong>Dynamic economy</strong>: Buy and sell illegal goods on a living black market.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6 <strong>Original soundtrack</strong>: 16 custom in-game music tracks to enhance the nightlife atmosphere.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras/bb7c60d40a28bab5f56250ef12fbcab8.poster.avif?t=1766238772\" width=770 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras/bb7c60d40a28bab5f56250ef12fbcab8.webm?t=1766238772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras/bb7c60d40a28bab5f56250ef12fbcab8.mp4?t=1766238772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Your city. Your club. Your rules.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras/2dc191feee3a88473cba22caa57d7fa1.avif?t=1766238772\" width=740 height=86 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2774040?t=1766238772","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/f6128454950efb63759ba2d19581007d2e4dcef3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766238772","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/e982755446ba8e849b41e8ce5570f0338c9ad14a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766238772","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/e982755446ba8e849b41e8ce5570f0338c9ad14a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766238772","categories":[{"description":