: Bribe the police, influence the mayor, or risk violent raids.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>RPG Mechanics:</strong> Train your crew and develop your crime family</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Prestige &amp; Unlocks:</strong> As you gain reputation, you\u2019ll unlock special items and new features</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb8 <strong>Dynamic economy</strong>: Buy and sell illegal goods on a living black market.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6 <strong>Original soundtrack</strong>: 16 custom in-game music tracks to enhance the nightlife atmosphere.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras/bb7c60d40a28bab5f56250ef12fbcab8.poster.avif?t=1766238772\" width=770 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras/bb7c60d40a28bab5f56250ef12fbcab8.webm?t=1766238772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras/bb7c60d40a28bab5f56250ef12fbcab8.mp4?t=1766238772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Your city. Your club. Your rules.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774040/extras/2dc191feee3a88473cba22caa57d7fa1.avif?t=1766238772\" width=740 height=86 /></span></p>","developers":["BEF GAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"htt